==Dialogue==
{{Stub Dialogue}}

===Speak with Eris, the lobby secretary{{subst:void|<!--201190601-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=History and Culture Museum|You helped the Belobog History and Culture Museum recover a valuable stolen artifact.<br />You learn from Pela that, as the museum is about to open to the public, they need a part-time operation manager.<br />This after-hours activity piques your curiosity. Go and say hello to Eris, the museum's lobby secretary.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Eris)
----
:'''Pela:''' (Trailblazer), I would like to introduce to you, Ms. Eris, the lobby secretary in the History and Culture Museum, Ms. Eris, this is the savior of Belobog. You should have heard of {{MC|ж=her|м=his}} name.
:'''Eris:''' Ah yes, I've heard so much about you! It's so nice to finally have the pleasure of meeting you!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nice to meet you, too.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're very pretty.
::'''Eris:''' I &mdash; huh? Uhh... Thank you, what a nice compliment!
:'''Pela:''' In addition to her secretarial duties, Eris is also a student at the Belobog College of Art. She's very knowledgeable about the museum's exhibits and their history.
:'''Pela:''' Eris, starting today, (Trailblazer) is going to be our museum manager. Please keep {{MC|ж=her|м=him}} updated on matters related to the opening and operation of the exhibits.
:'''Eris:''' My pleasure, Miss Pela! Leave it to me, I'll keep our manager up to speed on every detail.
:'''Eris:''' (Trailblazer), would you like to begin with the museum's workflows?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You bet I would.
:'''Eris:''' That's the spirit! Let's get started then.
----
;(If )
:{{Диалог|Журнал путешествий}} Start Museum Management
;(If )
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} I have some questions...
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What does the museum do?
:::'''Eris:''' Belobog History and Culture Museum is the largest comprehensive museum in Belobog under the Ministry of Culture in Qlipoth, covering a wide range of history, culture and art!
:::'''Eris:''' Our museum is dedicated to providing a welcoming and accessible experience for all visitors. While exploring the exhibits, be sure to take a break in our rest area. And don't miss out on our occasional themed events!
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What do you have in your exhibitions?
:::'''Eris:''' There are three permanent exhibition areas in the Belobog History and Culture Museum, and they are: The General Hall, the Industrial Hall, and the History-Culture Hall!
:::'''Eris:''' The three different areas each have different kinds of historical artifacts on display. You can see Belobog from different angles in each of the areas. Other than that, we will occasionally have themed exhibitions that you can check out!
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} I want to know more about you, Eris...
:::'''Eris:''' Eh!? Me...?
:::'''Eris:''' I... I'm just a student of the Belobog College of Art... Curator Uldan is my mentor, and I'm here to do my internship under him...
:::'''Eris:''' I&mdash;In short, I'm just an ordinary person, and my stories are as boring as they come...
:::'''Eris:''' L&mdash;Let's talk about museum, shall we?
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} That's all I wanted to know.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|Выход}} I'll leave you to it.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You bet I would.
{{Dialogue End}}

